WEBVTT

00:19.110 --> 00:26.070
(I Left My A-Rank Party to Help My Former
Students Reach the Dungeon Depths)

01:40.980 --> 01:47.490
(Episode 14:
One Gold)

01:51.060 --> 01:53.490
So you're saying this dungeon

01:53.850 --> 01:57.280
is a city from another
world called Glad Shi-im,

01:57.280 --> 02:01.000
and this King Vordan was trying
to save the city and its people

02:01.400 --> 02:03.700
by using a special type of magic

02:03.700 --> 02:08.010
to transport it across
dimensions to our world?

02:08.340 --> 02:09.190
Yes.

02:09.190 --> 02:10.890
That is correct.

02:11.240 --> 02:13.390
But the people of the city disappeared,

02:13.390 --> 02:16.330
and now strange monsters
seem to have taken it over.

02:16.330 --> 02:21.020
Those monsters are
the people of Glad Shi-im.

02:25.530 --> 02:28.460
Their humanity was sacrificed.

02:28.460 --> 02:29.900
What does that mean?

02:30.260 --> 02:32.050
Look at this.

02:32.860 --> 02:35.370
I've been wondering about that.

02:35.370 --> 02:37.410
Just what is this artifact?

02:37.790 --> 02:41.220
We made it per Rain's request.

02:41.870 --> 02:45.040
Something to help with the
ring's appraisal, yes?

02:45.410 --> 02:46.480
Watch.

02:53.700 --> 02:54.900
What's this place?

02:54.900 --> 02:59.390
The Glad Shi-im of the past,
taken over by the Sunset.

02:59.390 --> 03:04.810
So the rings you found on the monsters
are capable of displaying images?

03:05.320 --> 03:07.680
Like magic gems for streaming?

03:10.880 --> 03:13.780
That's what I thought at first, too,

03:13.780 --> 03:16.210
but what's recorded on these rings...

03:17.470 --> 03:19.950
is the information
about the people themselves.

03:21.600 --> 03:24.930
King Vordan tried to
relocate the entire city,

03:24.930 --> 03:28.180
but the magic was imperfect.

03:28.180 --> 03:31.470
It's too difficult for a human
body to cross dimensions.

03:31.470 --> 03:35.350
So the king thought that
perhaps it would work

03:35.800 --> 03:37.850
if they were not human.

03:38.970 --> 03:41.640
The very idea is madness.

03:41.640 --> 03:46.230
The king must have already been
under the Sunset's influence.

03:48.660 --> 03:54.360
King Vordan possessed an
item called the One Gold.

03:54.820 --> 04:01.200
We are still investigating what this
item is and where he acquired it.

04:01.200 --> 04:02.960
According to the Golden Priestess...

04:03.250 --> 04:05.560
That which no human should touch,

04:05.560 --> 04:07.430
the cursed universal vessel,

04:07.430 --> 04:11.710
the fruit of the World Tree
that grants all wishes.

04:12.040 --> 04:17.410
The One Gold granted the king's
wish and created golden rings.

04:17.410 --> 04:19.600
He then gave the rings to the people

04:19.600 --> 04:22.890
and did what needed to be done
to get them across dimensions.

04:22.890 --> 04:24.270
And as a result...

04:24.590 --> 04:28.000
Due to the imperfect magic
and the effects of the Sunset,

04:28.000 --> 04:29.880
the people turned into monsters,

04:29.880 --> 04:34.280
and Glad Shi-im appeared
in this world as a dungeon.

04:38.480 --> 04:43.790
So what happens if we simply
allow it to exist, Hero?

04:44.090 --> 04:46.620
The Golden Priestess also said...

04:46.940 --> 04:52.880
Yuke Feldio, stop the Twilight King
and destroy the gold.

04:53.260 --> 04:59.390
Should you fail, this world will be
swallowed by the twilight as well.

05:02.940 --> 05:06.140
As she said, we must destroy it.

05:06.480 --> 05:07.880
Can you do that?

05:07.880 --> 05:09.520
We have to.

05:10.300 --> 05:11.800
Indeed...

05:13.510 --> 05:18.280
Yuke Feldio, you have been given the
duty and privilege of being the hero.

05:18.680 --> 05:20.660
Devote your efforts to this kingdom.

05:21.260 --> 05:22.010
I will.

05:22.790 --> 05:25.360
Mom, I'm hungry!

05:25.360 --> 05:28.210
Oh? Well, then, I'll have to
make a big dinner, won't I?

05:28.210 --> 05:29.700
- Yeah! What're you gonna make?

05:29.700 --> 05:31.090
- I can't allow this world to
be swallowed by the Sunset.
- Yeah! What're you gonna make?

05:31.090 --> 05:33.920
- I can't allow this world to
be swallowed by the Sunset.

05:34.220 --> 05:36.050
Yuke, your brow's wrinkled.

05:38.850 --> 05:40.360
Let's head back to the inn.

05:40.360 --> 05:43.930
We should get plenty of
rest while we can, right?

05:44.230 --> 05:45.690
You're right.

05:45.690 --> 05:49.800
We always have to be ready to put
on the best performance we can.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.560
Yep.

05:58.870 --> 06:00.280
I've been looking for you.

06:01.450 --> 06:02.410
Who are you?

06:04.200 --> 06:06.410
I'm your uncle, Rhaenys.

06:07.660 --> 06:09.840
You got my letter, didn't you?

06:09.840 --> 06:11.540
Now, come with me at once!

06:11.860 --> 06:15.800
I don't know who you are, but I
think you have the wrong person.

06:16.140 --> 06:19.160
You must be Yuke Feldio.

06:19.160 --> 06:21.360
That girl belongs to our family.

06:21.360 --> 06:23.050
We'll be taking her back.

06:23.360 --> 06:27.520
Is she? I was told that she didn't
have any family left in the world.

06:28.120 --> 06:31.370
Restrain her. I don't care
if she gets roughed up a bit.

06:31.370 --> 06:32.310
Yes, sir.

06:32.310 --> 06:33.360
Snare.

06:34.360 --> 06:35.360
(Snare)

06:35.360 --> 06:37.110
Sleep Mist.

06:37.110 --> 06:39.360
(Sleep Mist)

06:43.490 --> 06:48.730
I-I am Bran Crowder, representative
of Count Crowder's household!

06:48.730 --> 06:52.540
This girl, Rhaenys, is the daughter of
Dimit, the current head of our household!

06:52.540 --> 06:54.000
You will give her to me!

06:54.000 --> 06:55.500
No, I will not.

06:55.500 --> 06:57.720
I know you got my letter!

06:57.720 --> 07:01.510
Rhaenys's marriage into the Salmutarian
royal family has been decided!

07:01.510 --> 07:04.260
I know nothing of that,
and I refuse to acknowledge it.

07:04.260 --> 07:05.690
Why, you—

07:05.690 --> 07:10.270
What makes you think Rain is Rhaenys,
the daughter of the count?

07:10.570 --> 07:11.520
Where's your proof?

07:11.820 --> 07:13.520
Proof?!

07:13.520 --> 07:21.560
Also, permission is required for someone
of noble blood to marry a foreigner.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.910
Do you have that?

07:23.500 --> 07:25.160
Why, you...

07:25.470 --> 07:28.640
In other words, you people
of the Crowder household

07:28.640 --> 07:31.750
only say that Rain
might be related to you,

07:31.750 --> 07:35.160
so that you can abduct her,
sell her off to Salmutaria,

07:35.160 --> 07:37.280
establish ties with their royalty
without approval,

07:37.280 --> 07:39.880
and make yourselves a
tidy profit. Am I wrong?

07:39.880 --> 07:41.990
And what's the problem with that?!

07:41.990 --> 07:45.180
She'll earn the title of queen consort
thanks to her status as a Crowder!

07:45.180 --> 07:47.890
The time has come at last
for her to be useful!

07:48.210 --> 07:49.720
Come, Rhaenys!

07:49.720 --> 07:52.020
Your father wishes to see you!

07:52.020 --> 07:54.490
Pierce, flash of light.

07:54.490 --> 07:56.270
I have no desire to see him.

07:56.270 --> 07:58.650
Y-You're going to be a queen!

07:58.940 --> 08:00.190
Energy Bolt.

08:01.240 --> 08:02.610
(Energy Bolt)

08:04.240 --> 08:07.460
Go home. I am Rain of Clover.

08:07.460 --> 08:09.120
I'm not Rhaenys.

08:19.270 --> 08:21.240
Well, we managed to run him off.

08:21.240 --> 08:23.550
Yeah. Thanks to you.

08:23.890 --> 08:29.810
We were right to have Mamar destroy all
evidence that you were the count's daughter.

08:30.120 --> 08:34.750
Yeah. I'll have to thank her
when we get back to Finis.

08:37.130 --> 08:39.190
I think I'm a bit tired now.

08:39.580 --> 08:41.620
I'll relax in the hot spring.

08:41.620 --> 08:42.940
Maybe I'll do that, too.

08:43.350 --> 08:44.700
Want to get in together?

08:45.850 --> 08:49.200
I have things I need to do,
so you can get in first.

08:49.560 --> 08:52.070
You thought about it for
a second, didn't you?

08:59.810 --> 09:02.090
Bran, where are the goods?

09:02.410 --> 09:04.760
W-Well, about that...

09:04.760 --> 09:07.550
I would like to request a bit more time.

09:07.550 --> 09:10.810
(Second Prince of Salmutaria  Mastoma)
I believe we have already
reached the day we agreed upon.

09:10.810 --> 09:14.450
As Rhaenys has become an adventurer,

09:14.450 --> 09:17.070
I'm afraid her temperament is a bit rough.

09:17.070 --> 09:20.640
When I told her that we
were coming to see you,

09:20.640 --> 09:22.820
she cast a spell at me.

09:23.470 --> 09:26.060
A woman acting out against a man?

09:26.060 --> 09:29.320
I will never understand how
the Welmelia Kingdom works.

09:29.630 --> 09:32.390
P-Preparations will be
completed with utmost haste.

09:32.390 --> 09:34.830
For the moment, I ask that you
please wait just a bit longer.

09:35.170 --> 09:36.340
Very well.

09:36.810 --> 09:41.040
I'll have uses for her that my other
wives can't fulfill, after all.

09:41.040 --> 09:42.600
O-Oh?

09:42.600 --> 09:43.850
Get it, Bran?

09:43.850 --> 09:44.880
Y-Yes, Your Highness.

09:45.240 --> 09:50.010
While I'm at it, why don't I take all
the girls Rhaenys hangs out with, too?

09:50.330 --> 09:51.010
Huh?

09:51.380 --> 09:54.520
I can't make them consorts,
but I have uses for them.

09:54.520 --> 09:56.390
B-But that would be...

09:56.760 --> 10:00.230
I'll pay you three—no, five
times the agreed amount.

10:01.530 --> 10:05.150
Understood! You can count
on me, Your Highness!

10:05.500 --> 10:08.110
Good. Then get out of here.

10:08.110 --> 10:09.590
I beg your pardon.

10:12.600 --> 10:14.980
Five times, eh?

10:14.980 --> 10:19.220
I'll get my hands on Clover,
no matter what it takes!

10:22.890 --> 10:26.360
That's it, Niberune.
You're doing very well.

10:26.360 --> 10:27.170
Thanks!

10:28.020 --> 10:29.600
So that's the deal.

10:29.600 --> 10:32.070
To destroy the One Gold,

10:32.070 --> 10:34.980
we'll head into the deepest
part of Glad Shi-im.

10:34.980 --> 10:39.600
The One Gold will probably be
in King Vordan's royal chamber.

10:40.490 --> 10:42.230
It's not going to be an easy quest,

10:42.920 --> 10:44.140
but please help.

10:44.140 --> 10:45.480
Right.

10:45.800 --> 10:48.110
Please don't worry so much.

10:48.110 --> 10:49.860
Was it that obvious?

10:50.150 --> 10:52.890
It'll be fine. We can do this.

10:52.890 --> 10:54.140
She's right!

10:54.140 --> 10:57.620
If all of us in Clover work
together, we can do anything!

10:57.970 --> 11:00.720
We won't cause trouble for you, Yuke!

11:00.720 --> 11:03.750
Yeah. Don't be overprotective of us.

11:04.040 --> 11:06.250
Okay, then. Thanks.

11:08.930 --> 11:10.790
In that case, Nene, Marina,

11:10.790 --> 11:13.190
could you go shopping for supplies?

11:13.190 --> 11:14.140
Got it!

11:14.470 --> 11:16.510
Can we take Rune with us?

11:16.510 --> 11:18.220
Just be careful.

11:18.220 --> 11:20.890
We will! Be back soon!

11:20.890 --> 11:22.580
See ya later!

11:22.580 --> 11:27.260
Master, you should relax until dinner.
Enjoy the hot spring, perhaps.

11:27.260 --> 11:29.400
Rain, you take a break, too.

11:29.710 --> 11:30.400
Okay.

11:30.400 --> 11:34.530
Actually, Silk, I'd like to come
up with a plan of attack first.

11:35.180 --> 11:38.650
I want to discuss it with
everyone after dinner, too.

11:40.010 --> 11:42.420
Master.

11:42.760 --> 11:44.420
Yuke.

11:44.950 --> 11:47.800
I'm... fine, really.

11:48.100 --> 11:52.180
Not a chance. I know you were
up late again last night.

11:52.180 --> 11:55.190
Well, that's... true, but...

11:55.190 --> 11:57.810
Rain, let's accompany him
to the hot spring.

11:58.140 --> 11:59.180
Okay.

12:01.160 --> 12:02.510
Wait, wait! I get it!

12:02.510 --> 12:04.670
I'll rest! I'll rest, okay?! Just wait a—

12:04.670 --> 12:06.610
Yes, yes. Now let's go!

12:06.610 --> 12:07.980
Just accept it.

12:13.420 --> 12:15.800
Let me try to make sense of
what's going on.

12:15.800 --> 12:17.480
Sure, Master.

12:17.480 --> 12:20.830
Why am I in the hot spring
with the two of you?

12:21.160 --> 12:23.190
Because if we leave you on your own,

12:23.190 --> 12:26.180
you'll go off and do
some sort of work again.

12:26.910 --> 12:29.090
You're so quick to overwork yourself.

12:29.430 --> 12:33.730
I-I'm aware of that,
but I'm not suffering for it!

12:33.730 --> 12:37.640
I honestly want to do whatever
I can to help all of you...

12:37.640 --> 12:41.490
Oh, it's just not fair
for you to be that way!

12:42.250 --> 12:43.350
H-Hey...

12:44.170 --> 12:47.070
Doing this relaxes me.

12:47.070 --> 12:50.720
You take very good care of us,

12:50.720 --> 12:53.360
but you don't take such
good care of yourself.

12:54.680 --> 12:56.800
It feels like you might
run off and leave us.

12:57.380 --> 13:00.450
I just want to make certain
that you're really here.

13:00.800 --> 13:01.500
Yeah.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.900
I'll be more careful.

13:03.900 --> 13:06.760
But you don't need to change who you are.

13:06.760 --> 13:09.460
We'll make sure you take
breaks, just like this.

13:09.460 --> 13:13.590
Okay, okay, I get it! Could you
move a bit farther away, please?

13:14.750 --> 13:19.050
Honestly, why must the leader of
our party be such a simple man?

13:19.390 --> 13:22.180
You never let your guard down around us.

13:22.180 --> 13:23.680
It makes us a little sad.

13:23.680 --> 13:25.810
That's not true at all!

13:28.870 --> 13:31.110
You always do things out of the blue.

13:31.520 --> 13:33.100
That surprised me.

13:33.100 --> 13:36.180
Well, when you keep goading me like
this, it's gonna touch a nerve.

13:36.180 --> 13:37.470
Really?

13:37.470 --> 13:40.240
He is a coward in the
weirdest ways, after all.

13:40.630 --> 13:44.660
I'm an A-rank adventurer, you know!
I don't go back on my word!

13:44.970 --> 13:46.660
Those two things aren't really connected.

13:47.030 --> 13:50.460
Exactly. You're definitely
being a bit weird, Master.

13:53.970 --> 13:56.200
Seriously, get off me! Please!

13:56.200 --> 13:58.380
No escaping allowed, Master!

13:58.830 --> 14:04.100
Oh my. When did my hot
spring become a mixed bath?

14:06.230 --> 14:09.360
(A Few Days Later)

14:09.360 --> 14:11.230
Niberune was taken?!
(A Few Days Later)

14:11.230 --> 14:16.960
An employee saw Fullbound
taking her into the dungeon.

14:16.960 --> 14:19.860
I'm sorry, Yuke! I looked
away for just a second...

14:19.860 --> 14:22.760
No, it's not your fault, Marina.

14:22.760 --> 14:24.540
I was careless, too.

14:24.540 --> 14:27.250
I should have stayed with her!

14:27.560 --> 14:29.120
No, I was—

14:29.120 --> 14:30.580
We'll discuss this later.

14:30.580 --> 14:32.750
We're going after Fullbound right now.

14:37.010 --> 14:40.640
Once we catch up to Fullbound
and get Niberune back,

14:40.640 --> 14:42.960
we'll head for the deepest
part of Vordan Castle.

14:42.960 --> 14:45.520
The One Gold should be there.

14:45.520 --> 14:49.060
Remember, your ultimate goal
is to destroy the One Gold.

14:49.400 --> 14:51.320
Please help me, everyone.

14:51.320 --> 14:53.130
No need to be so worked up.

14:53.130 --> 14:54.660
You guys can do this.

14:54.660 --> 14:55.700
That's right!

14:55.700 --> 14:58.570
You'll have us to back you up, too.

14:58.870 --> 15:00.660
We're counting on you.

15:00.660 --> 15:04.450
And make sure you all come
back alive, you hear?

15:04.810 --> 15:06.950
Scordia, forward!

15:07.320 --> 15:09.580
Carmine, let's get going!

15:13.030 --> 15:14.390
Everyone ready?

15:14.390 --> 15:17.060
Yeah! Let's go get Rune back!

15:17.060 --> 15:18.840
Let's do this, Yuke.

15:18.840 --> 15:21.930
I have the route memorized. Let's hurry.

15:21.930 --> 15:24.600
Leave the advance precautions to me!

15:24.920 --> 15:26.770
Let's go, Clover!

15:26.770 --> 15:28.010
And be careful!

15:35.020 --> 15:36.600
Chrysalises ahead!

15:36.600 --> 15:37.860
Ten of them!

15:41.490 --> 15:42.240
Marona!

15:42.550 --> 15:45.030
You can leave these guys to us.

15:45.030 --> 15:46.490
Go on ahead.

15:46.800 --> 15:47.810
But...

15:47.810 --> 15:49.750
You gotta save Rune, right?

15:50.130 --> 15:53.480
Yuke, keep your priorities straight.

15:53.480 --> 15:57.040
We're here to provide
support for you this time.

15:57.040 --> 15:59.060
Don't lose sight of the goal!

15:59.060 --> 16:00.260
I appreciate it.

16:00.610 --> 16:02.770
Everyone, begin combat!

16:02.770 --> 16:05.640
And don't look those things in the eye!

16:14.160 --> 16:16.790
Fifteen, sixteen...

16:17.560 --> 16:19.300
There are quite a few of them.

16:19.300 --> 16:21.620
What shall we do, Lucent?

16:21.620 --> 16:25.590
We hold them here so Clover
can move forward, of course.

16:25.590 --> 16:27.780
But there are far too many.

16:28.040 --> 16:32.040
It'll work out. You young ones
just need to look forward.

16:32.830 --> 16:35.560
All right, then. Let's meet up later.

16:35.560 --> 16:36.540
Right.

16:38.540 --> 16:41.710
Taste the blizzard
of the frozen wasteland!

16:42.040 --> 16:45.090
Grade 5 Magic: Blizzard!

16:45.840 --> 16:48.350
(Blizzard)

16:48.790 --> 16:51.400
Burn the evil ones to ash!

16:51.400 --> 16:54.390
Grade 4 Magic: Fire Ball!

16:54.390 --> 16:55.980
(Fire Ball)

16:57.030 --> 16:57.830
Let's go!

16:58.900 --> 17:01.480
Time to conquer Vordan Castle!

17:08.090 --> 17:10.060
Multiple sets of footprints...

17:10.060 --> 17:12.620
and one set that's smaller.

17:12.620 --> 17:14.750
Is it Fullbound and Rune?

17:14.750 --> 17:15.750
It is.

17:15.750 --> 17:18.500
They're headed straight
for the royal chamber.

17:18.840 --> 17:22.530
Looks like we'll be meeting them
at our ultimate destination.

17:23.070 --> 17:23.880
Let's go.

17:26.640 --> 17:27.380
Guard up!

17:32.990 --> 17:34.140
Loge!

17:34.450 --> 17:39.770
It has been some time,
Mr. Feldio and all of you.

17:40.310 --> 17:45.980
We learned a lot about Glad Shi-im
after you showed us to the archive.

17:45.980 --> 17:48.000
Including who you are.

17:48.000 --> 17:50.800
Is that so?

17:50.800 --> 17:52.530
Loge Vordanian,

17:52.530 --> 17:54.640
son of King Vordan.

17:55.210 --> 17:58.500
Those days are far in the past.

17:58.880 --> 18:03.500
And Rune is the daughter of
your younger sister, Frya.

18:03.830 --> 18:06.920
So, um... That means Rune is...

18:06.920 --> 18:09.460
The granddaughter of King Vordan.

18:10.090 --> 18:17.330
She is the key that her mage
father and I left behind.

18:18.420 --> 18:22.980
King Vordan—my father—made a mistake.

18:22.980 --> 18:28.820
He was never capable of
ruling over so many people.

18:32.100 --> 18:36.100
I do hope you will make
the best possible choice.

18:47.480 --> 18:49.590
We're gonna be rich!

18:49.930 --> 18:51.720
I hear Zaccard!

18:51.720 --> 18:53.790
So this is the royal chamber.

18:53.790 --> 18:56.670
And the One Gold is in here, right?

18:56.670 --> 18:58.730
Rune should be here, too.

18:59.120 --> 19:01.010
Come, Biblion.

19:07.440 --> 19:10.360
Please let us know
if you sense any danger.

19:10.700 --> 19:11.490
Ready?

19:11.940 --> 19:15.240
We're going to rescue Rune
and destroy the One Gold.

19:15.880 --> 19:16.720
Let's go!

19:23.090 --> 19:24.380
Zaccard!

19:26.160 --> 19:27.500
Where's Niberune?!

19:28.880 --> 19:30.110
Yuke!

19:35.390 --> 19:36.450
Is that King Vordan?!

19:36.450 --> 19:37.640
Look beside him!

19:40.670 --> 19:42.360
Rune!

19:44.900 --> 19:46.520
Stay out of our way!

19:46.910 --> 19:49.900
This dungeon has already been conquered,

19:49.900 --> 19:51.500
and not by you.

19:51.500 --> 19:55.690
We of Fullbound conquered
the whole thing on our own!

19:55.690 --> 19:56.330
Huh?

19:56.780 --> 19:59.060
The moment we brought that brat in here,

19:59.060 --> 20:01.870
we won the race.
That's all there is to it.

20:02.200 --> 20:03.430
The race?

20:03.430 --> 20:07.730
You were still competing to
finish first after all this?!

20:07.730 --> 20:09.380
And you dragged Rune into it?!

20:09.880 --> 20:11.720
Are you guys insane?!

20:12.090 --> 20:18.470
I'm not gonna let outsiders like you guys
order us around or get the jump on us.

20:25.610 --> 20:27.580
What are you doing?!

20:27.580 --> 20:30.190
We shouldn't be fighting
amongst ourselves!

20:30.190 --> 20:33.700
Shut up! I never liked you from the start!

20:34.010 --> 20:36.010
We're the ones who represent Duna!

20:36.010 --> 20:39.800
And then you jerks just came barging
in like you owned the place!

20:39.800 --> 20:41.700
You made a laughingstock of us!

20:43.210 --> 20:45.830
I hate you most of all!

20:45.830 --> 20:48.270
Maybe you're a popular
streaming party or whatever,

20:48.270 --> 20:51.160
but you're just a playboy
waitin' on a bunch of chicks!

20:51.160 --> 20:52.710
You think adventuring is a joke?!

20:52.710 --> 20:55.340
What?! You're just jealous!

20:55.340 --> 20:57.720
A jealous man is such an ugly thing.

20:57.720 --> 21:01.850
Could you guys not throw
fuel on the fire, please?

21:01.850 --> 21:04.550
It couldn't be more pathetic.

21:04.550 --> 21:06.980
Go get a life already!

21:06.980 --> 21:08.310
Oh, come on...

21:09.170 --> 21:10.730
You're all just a buncha...

21:11.150 --> 21:13.740
Hey, kingster! Here's a wish for ya!

21:14.100 --> 21:17.820
Give us power! Power!

22:55.960 --> 22:57.310
(Crossing Time)

22:57.310 --> 22:59.560
(Crossing Time)
Next time, "Crossing Time."

